    "setup_note": "Android app state and SmartHome reset are generated from the task spec and task asset directory.",
    "evaluate_note": "Plan8 scores the four public Sleep Decision fields and the future bedtime planned effects; it does not require immediate state changes or command-history purity.",
    "device_topology": "android_smarthome",
